      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine pecans, brown sugar, flour, and apple pie spice in a small bowl. Place apple wedges in a medium bowl; drizzle with butter and toss to coat. Arrange apples in a single layer in the air fryer basket and sprinkle with pecan mixture.",
